# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 1: A simple constrained problem {#example-1-a-simple-constrained-problem}"
msgstr "Exemplul 1: O problemă simplă cu constrângeri {#example-1-a-simple-constrained-problem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The first example shows how to use the function with [LP-files](https://www.ibm.com/docs/en/icos/22.1.1?topic=cplex-lp-file-format-algebraic-representation), a common optimization problem specification used in operations research. You will formulate the following arbitrary optimization problem of five binary variables $x_i \\in \\{0,1\\}$ subject to two constraints:\n"
"$$\n"
"    \\min x_1 x_2 + 2 x_2 x_3 - x_3 x_4 - 2 x_4 x_5 - 2 x_1 x_3 - 4 x_2 x_5 \\\\\n"
"    \\text{s.t.}\\quad x_1 + x_2 + x_3 \\leq 1 \\\\\n"
"    \\quad x_3 - x_4 + x_5 = 0\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Primul exemplu arată cum se utilizează funcția cu [fișiere LP](https://www.ibm.com/docs/en/icos/22.1.1?topic=cplex-lp-file-format-algebraic-representation), o specificație obișnuită pentru probleme de optimizare utilizată în cercetarea operațională. Vei formula următoarea problemă de optimizare arbitrară cu cinci variabile binare $x_i \\in \\{0,1\\}$ supuse la două constrângeri:\n"
"$$\n"
"    \\min x_1 x_2 + 2 x_2 x_3 - x_3 x_4 - 2 x_4 x_5 - 2 x_1 x_3 - 4 x_2 x_5 \\\\\n"
"    \\text{s.t.}\\quad x_1 + x_2 + x_3 \\leq 1 \\\\\n"
"    \\quad x_3 - x_4 + x_5 = 0\n"
"$$\n"

